Python Fundamentals for DevOps

1. Variables            → store values
2. String               → text data
3. List                 → [ ] ordered changeable collection
4. Tuple                → ( ) ordered fixed collection
5. Dictionary           → { } key-value pairs
6. Set                  → unique values only

7. If/else              → conditions
8. For loop             → repeat tasks
9. While loop           → repeated execution

10. Functions           → reusable code blocks
11. Classes             → object-oriented programming

12. File handling       → read/write files
13. Exception handling  → handle errors
14. Try/except          → prevent script failures
